flowchart TB
Operator[Operator] --> Web[Vercel static interface]
Web --> Proxy[Node same-origin proxy]
Proxy --> API[Render FastAPI operator session and CSRF]
API --> Propose[Bounded motion proposal]
Propose --> Approve[Separate approval within deadline]
Approve --> Safety[Independent SafetyGate freshness limits and stopped state]
Safety --> Sim[Synthetic joint simulation]
Sim --> Journal[Turso staging journal and exclusive owner lease]
Sim --> Telemetry[Software telemetry to interface]
Watchdog[Heartbeat loss revocation or emergency stop] --> Stop[Revoke authority and stop]
Stop --> Sim
Restart[Restart] --> Stopped[Clear sessions cancel unfinished tasks start stopped]
subgraph Edge[LOCAL EDGE - preparatory only]
ROS[ROS 2 SimulationTelemetry and SimulationProposal messages]
Sensors[Vision audio VLA sensor controller interfaces - planned]
Actuator[Physical drivers and actuation - unavailable and forbidden]
end
API -. no implemented physical bridge .-> ROS
Sensors -. hardware qualification required .-> Actuator
